<https://0k.computer/ontology#verifiedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://0k.computer/ontology#verifiedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://0k.computer/ontology#Concept> .
<https://0k.computer/ontology#verifiedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A literate eval spec that drives a real actor through real surfaces to a real outcome. The single source of evidence that an affordance holds. A Decision may also claim verifiedBy when the literate spec verifies the affordances it defines." .
