<https://0k.computer/ontology/software> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The publishable slice of the infrastructure domain: Affordance, Signifier, Surface, Bundle, and the edges among them and the document genus. Split out of product (ontology-modules §2) so a publication that ships core and document can ship the affordance vocabulary its documents use without importing work or actor. Keeps the base namespace, like product. SoftwareModule stays in product: it is rdfs:subClassOf Artifact, which work defines." .
